[world]
{% if everyday -%}
In narration and dialogue, call things by their everyday names: where a name is followed by "usually called ...", use that name, and keep the full name for formal moments.
{% endif -%}
{% if goal -%}
Goal: {{ goal }}
{% endif -%}
{% if place -%}
Place: {{ place.name }}{% if place.everyday %} (usually called {{ place.everyday }}){% endif %}
{% for fact in place.facts -%}
- {{ fact }}
{% endfor -%}
{% endif -%}
{% for entry in lore %}
{{ entry.name }}{% if entry.everyday %} (usually called {{ entry.everyday }}){% endif %}
{% for fact in entry.facts -%}
- {{ fact }}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor -%}
{% if spheres %}
Spheres this scene touches (faiths, nations, orders, cultures): keep what they hold true, and bring it in only where the scene calls for it.
{% for sphere in spheres -%}
{{ sphere.name }} ({{ sphere.template }}{% if sphere.everyday %}, usually called {{ sphere.everyday }}{% endif %})
{% if sphere.parent_summary %}- Part of {{ sphere.parent_name }}: {{ sphere.parent_summary }}
{% endif -%}
{% for line in sphere.key_facts -%}
- {{ line }}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor -%}
{% endif -%}
{% if cast %}
Who is here, by heritage (keep every description and action true to these bodies and instincts):
{% for member in cast -%}
- {{ member.name }}{% if member.heritage %} ({{ member.heritage }}){% endif %}:{% for fact in member.body %} {{ fact }}{% endfor %}{% if member.instincts %} Instincts:{% for fact in member.instincts %} {{ fact }}{% endfor %}{% endif %}
{% endfor -%}
{% endif -%}
[end of world]
